diff --git slices/grounding/logic/design/LOGIC-SHACL-AF.md slices/grounding/logic/design/LOGIC-SHACL-AF.md
index ca09e7898..a0e16e19f 100644
--- slices/grounding/logic/design/LOGIC-SHACL-AF.md
+++ slices/grounding/logic/design/LOGIC-SHACL-AF.md
@@ -81,6 +81,9 @@ shapes the result/frame projections emit (those validate; these derive):
   The body/head lowering is the **same** rule-to-relational lowering the Datalog and
   N3 targets use ([`LOGIC-IR.md`](LOGIC-IR.md)); there is one lowering, reused, so the
   surfaces cannot drift from each other.
+- A rule's `logic:distinctBody` guard compares RDF term identity. Its two ordered
+  variable arguments lower to `FILTER(!sameTerm(?A, ?B))`, preserving distinctions
+  between RDF literals that have equal numeric values but different RDF terms.
 - A **reduce** rule lowers to an aggregating `CONSTRUCT` — `GROUP BY` over the group
   key, the aggregate function in the projection — inside the same `sh:SPARQLRule`. The
   map case is the non-aggregating special case of the same projector.
diff --git slices/grounding/logic/i18n/fr.po slices/grounding/logic/i18n/fr.po
index c050b1fb9..5b60f319d 100644
--- slices/grounding/logic/i18n/fr.po
+++ slices/grounding/logic/i18n/fr.po
@@ -5259,16 +5259,16 @@ msgid "Relates a logic:ReasoningContract to the logic:ArgumentationSemantics it
 msgstr "Relie un logic:ReasoningContract à la logic:ArgumentationSemantics qu'il sélectionne — comment les conflits entre arguments réfutables sont résolus. À valeur unique sur le contrat. Domaine logic:ReasoningContract, portée logic:ArgumentationSemantics (exprimé en prose, conformément à la convention domaine/portée du module)."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/argument|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "Relates a logic:ArgumentStructure — an atomic-predication logic:Formula (over logic:relation) or a logic:FunctionTerm (over logic:functionSymbol) — to one of its argument term-carriers. The SAME property carries both, so a function term's operands reuse the predication argument machinery. Each carrier fixes its position with logic:termIndex and its value with exactly one term-value property (logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker, or logic:termApplication), so a variadic argument list — including sequence markers and nested compound function terms — round-trips with its order and term kinds intact. It is not a direct link to the term value and carries no ordering by triple position."
-msgstr "Relie une logic:ArgumentStructure — une logic:Formula de prédication atomique (sur logic:relation) ou un logic:FunctionTerm (sur logic:functionSymbol) — à l'un de ses porteurs de terme-argument. La MÊME propriété porte les deux, si bien que les opérandes d'un terme fonctionnel réutilisent la machinerie d'argument de prédication. Chaque porteur fixe sa position avec logic:termIndex et sa valeur avec exactement une propriété de valeur-de-terme (logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker ou logic:termApplication), si bien qu'une liste d'arguments variadique — y compris les marqueurs de séquence et les termes fonctionnels composés imbriqués — fait l'aller-retour avec son ordre et ses genres de terme intacts. Ce n'est pas un lien direct vers la valeur du terme et cela ne porte aucun ordre par position de triplet."
+msgid "Relates a logic:ArgumentStructure to an ordered argument term-carrier. Atomic formulas, function terms and rule inequality guards share this structural link. Each carrier fixes its position with logic:termIndex and its value with exactly one term-value property, preserving order and term kinds independently of RDF statement order. It is not a direct link to the term value."
+msgstr "Relie une logic:ArgumentStructure à un porteur de terme d’argument ordonné. Les formules atomiques, les termes fonctionnels et les gardes d’inégalité de règle partagent ce lien structurel. Chaque porteur fixe sa position par logic:termIndex et sa valeur par exactement une propriété de valeur de terme, préservant l’ordre et la nature des termes indépendamment de l’ordre des énoncés RDF. Ce n’est pas un lien direct vers la valeur du terme."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/argument|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
 msgid "The atom ex:knows(alice,bob) uses carriers at indices 0 and 1 linked through logic:argument."
 msgstr "L'atome ex:knows(alice,bob) emploie des porteurs aux indices 0 et 1 reliés via logic:argument."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ArgumentStructure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "A node that applies a reified operator to an ordered list of logic:argument term-carriers: an atomic-predication logic:Formula (operator = logic:relation) or a logic:FunctionTerm (operator = logic:functionSymbol). It is the shared rdfs:domain of logic:argument, so the ordered argument-carrier machinery is reused across both without asserting that a function term is a formula or that a formula is a term."
-msgstr "Un nœud qui applique un opérateur réifié à une liste ordonnée de porteurs de terme logic:argument : une logic:Formula de prédication atomique (opérateur = logic:relation) ou un logic:FunctionTerm (opérateur = logic:functionSymbol). C'est le rdfs:domain partagé de logic:argument, si bien que la machinerie ordonnée de porteur-d'argument est réutilisée entre les deux sans affirmer qu'un terme fonctionnel est une formule ni qu'une formule est un terme."
+msgid "A node applying an operator to an ordered list of logic:argument term-carriers. The operator is explicit as logic:relation on an atomic logic:Formula or logic:functionSymbol on a logic:FunctionTerm, or supplied structurally by a rule’s logic:distinctBody link. It is the shared domain of logic:argument; sharing the ordered carrier machinery does not assert that a guard or function term is a formula."
+msgstr "Un nœud appliquant un opérateur à une liste ordonnée de porteurs de termes logic:argument. L’opérateur est explicite via logic:relation sur une logic:Formula atomique ou logic:functionSymbol sur un logic:FunctionTerm, ou fourni structurellement par le lien logic:distinctBody d’une règle. C’est le domaine commun de logic:argument ; partager les porteurs ordonnés n’affirme pas qu’une garde ou un terme fonctionnel soit une formule."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Aspect|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
 msgid "A moment (trope): an endurant that exists only by inhering in a bearer on which it existentially depends — a colour, a belief, a marriage's commitment. The counterpart of gufo:Aspect, covering its intrinsic/extrinsic split (gufo:IntrinsicAspect inheres in a single bearer, gufo:ExtrinsicAspect depends on several): logic: carries that distinction on the inherence/dependence relation rather than as separate classes. The dependent counterpart of logic:Substantial. Qualities and modes are aspects (stated in prose, not as a subclass edge)."
@@ -6715,8 +6715,8 @@ msgid "Inequality body guard of a logic:Rule. Default-absent: a rule that needs
 msgstr "Garde de corps d'inégalité d'une logic:Rule. Absente par défaut : une règle n'exigeant aucune inégalité ne porte aucune logic:distinctBody, de sorte que le corpus existant demeure identique octet pour octet."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/distinctBody|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "Relates a logic:Rule to an inequality body guard: a reified node carrying rdf:subject and rdf:object (two rule variables, and — unlike logic:body — no rdf:predicate) that must bind to DISTINCT values for the rule to fire, projecting to the Datalog inequality constraint ?A != ?B. Parallel to logic:negatedBody as an additive rule-structural surface: it lets a rule detect 'at least two distinct values' (e.g. a class carrying more than one stereotype, or a relator mediating two distinct relata) that set-semantic Datalog cannot otherwise express. An inequality guard introduces no negative dependency edge, so it leaves a rule's stratification class unchanged."
-msgstr "Relie une logic:Rule à une garde de corps d'inégalité : un nœud réifié portant rdf:subject et rdf:object (deux variables de règle et — à la différence de logic:body — aucun rdf:predicate) qui doivent se lier à des valeurs DISTINCTES pour que la règle se déclenche, se projetant vers la contrainte d'inégalité Datalog ?A != ?B. Parallèle à logic:negatedBody en tant que surface structurelle-de-règle additive : elle permet à une règle de détecter « au moins deux valeurs distinctes » (p. ex. une classe portant plus d'un stéréotype, ou un relateur médiatisant deux relata distincts) que le Datalog à sémantique ensembliste ne peut autrement exprimer. Une garde d'inégalité n'introduit aucune arête de dépendance négative, si bien qu'elle laisse inchangée la classe de stratification d'une règle."
+msgid "Relates a logic:Rule to an RDF-term inequality guard with exactly two ordered logic:argument carriers at logic:termIndex 0 and 1, each carrying one logic:termVariable. Both variables must be bound by the positive body and must denote different RDF terms for the rule to fire. This is term identity, not SPARQL value inequality: differently typed numeric literals can be distinct RDF terms with equal values. The guard introduces no negative dependency edge and leaves stratification unchanged. It projects to Datalog term inequality and SPARQL FILTER(!sameTerm(?A, ?B))."
+msgstr "Relie une logic:Rule à une garde d’inégalité de termes RDF avec exactement deux porteurs logic:argument ordonnés aux logic:termIndex 0 et 1, portant chacun une logic:termVariable. Les deux variables doivent être liées par le corps positif et désigner des termes RDF différents pour déclencher la règle. Il s’agit de l’identité des termes, non de l’inégalité des valeurs SPARQL : des littéraux numériques de types différents peuvent être des termes RDF distincts de valeurs égales. La garde n’introduit aucune dépendance négative et conserve la stratification. Elle se projette en inégalité de termes Datalog et en SPARQL FILTER(!sameTerm(?A, ?B))."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/distinctnessRole|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
 msgid "Relates a logic:RelatumDistinctnessAssertion to one of the two roles that must bind distinct values on a focus node. Exactly two are asserted per record; the native coherence gate raises a violation when both roles bind the same value on one focus node. Domain logic:RelatumDistinctnessAssertion; two-valued. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
@@ -8351,8 +8351,8 @@ msgid "Negation-as-failure body atom of a logic:Rule. Default-absent: a positive
 msgstr "Atome de corps de négation par l'échec d'une logic:Rule. Absent par défaut : une règle de Horn positive ne possède que des atomes logic:body et aucun logic:negatedBody, de sorte que le corpus positif existant reste inchangé."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/negatedBody|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "Relates a logic:Rule to a negated (negation-as-failure) body atom: the antecedent literal that must NOT be derivable for the rule to fire. Parallel to logic:body (the positive antecedent atoms) but read under closed-world negation, so a rule with any logic:negatedBody atom requires at least logic:StratifiedNAFProfile rather than logic:PositiveHornProfile. The atom itself is a reified rdf:subject/rdf:predicate/rdf:object triple exactly as for logic:body; only its polarity differs."
-msgstr "Relie une logic:Rule à un atome de corps nié (négation-par-l'échec) : le littéral antécédent qui ne doit PAS être dérivable pour que la règle se déclenche. Parallèle à logic:body (les atomes antécédents positifs) mais lu sous négation à monde clos, de sorte qu'une règle comportant tout atome logic:negatedBody requiert au moins logic:StratifiedNAFProfile plutôt que logic:PositiveHornProfile. L'atome lui-même est un triplet rdf:subject/rdf:predicate/rdf:object réifié exactement comme pour logic:body ; seule sa polarité diffère."
+msgid "Relates a logic:Rule to a negation-as-failure body atom: an RDF 1.2 reifier whose rdf:reifies target is the quoted triple term, exactly as for logic:body. Typed logic:TermCarrier resources represent variables in any triple-term position; literals remain literal values. The atom must not be derivable for the rule to fire. A rule with a negated body requires at least logic:StratifiedNAFProfile rather than logic:PositiveHornProfile. Quoting an atom never asserts its proposition."
+msgstr "Relie une logic:Rule à un atome de corps sous négation par l’échec : un réificateur RDF 1.2 dont la cible rdf:reifies est le terme triple cité, exactement comme pour logic:body. Des ressources typées logic:TermCarrier représentent les variables dans toute position du terme triple ; les littéraux restent des valeurs littérales. L’atome ne doit pas être dérivable pour déclencher la règle. Une règle avec un corps nié exige au minimum logic:StratifiedNAFProfile plutôt que logic:PositiveHornProfile. Citer un atome n’affirme jamais sa proposition."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/negationOperator|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
 msgid "Relates a logic:ReasoningContract to a logic:NegationOperator its programs may use. Set-valued on the contract: a program may legitimately use explicit (strong) negation and negation-as-failure together, so this records the permitted operator set, not a single chosen operator. Domain logic:ReasoningContract, range logic:NegationOperator (stated in prose, matching the module's convention)."
@@ -10639,8 +10639,8 @@ msgid "A central record asserting that a class is identified by a KEY: the value
 msgstr "Un enregistrement central affirmant qu'une classe est identifiée par une CLÉ : la valeur d'une seule propriété clé désigne de manière unique l'instance de la classe, de sorte que deux instances qui s'accordent sur la valeur de la clé sont le même individu — et deux instances affirmées distinctes mais concordantes constituent une contradiction. Il nomme la classe avec logic:keyClass et la propriété clé avec logic:keyProperty, la paire que la porte de cohérence DL native associe pour décider du conflit d'accord de clé, et porte une rétro-référence logic:formalizes vers la propriété du domaine dont il encode la prose. Il s'agit du porteur logic: canonique d'une clé de type donnée/propriété unique : frappé de manière autonome (l'analogue logic: d'un axiome OWL 2 DL OWL hasKey, qui, sur une propriété de type donnée, est l'alternative sûre pour DL à un OWL InverseFunctionalProperty OWL 2 Full), de sorte que la clé est une obligation de raisonnement native plutôt qu'un triplet source OWL hasKey. L'autorité de raisonnement la nomme et l'applique ici ; l'axiome OWL OWL hasKey en est la vue DL avec perte et le sh:maxCount 1 inverse dérivé en est la projection SHACL."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "An ordered slot in an atomic formula's logic:argument list, a function term's logic:argument list, or a quantifier's logic:quantifiedVariable block. It carries exactly one zero-based logic:termIndex and exactly one value kind: logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker, or logic:termApplication (a nested compound function term). It is not the term value itself; it is the RDF node that preserves the value's kind and position independently of triple order."
-msgstr "Un emplacement ordonné dans la liste logic:argument d'une formule atomique, dans la liste logic:argument d'un terme fonctionnel, ou dans le bloc logic:quantifiedVariable d'un quantificateur. Il porte exactement un logic:termIndex indexé à partir de zéro et exactement un type de valeur : logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker, ou logic:termApplication (un terme fonctionnel composé imbriqué). Il n'est pas la valeur du terme elle-même ; c'est le nœud RDF qui préserve le type et la position de la valeur indépendamment de l'ordre des triplets."
+msgid "A structural RDF resource preserving one term value and its kind: logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker, or logic:termApplication. An ordered argument or quantified-variable carrier has exactly one zero-based logic:termIndex. A carrier occupying a native RDF 1.2 triple-term position needs no index because that position already fixes its role. It is not the term value itself and never asserts a domain membership for that value."
+msgstr "Une ressource RDF structurelle préservant une valeur de terme et sa nature : logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker ou logic:termApplication. Un porteur d’argument ordonné ou de variable quantifiée possède exactement un logic:termIndex à partir de zéro. Un porteur occupant une position native de terme triple RDF 1.2 n’exige aucun indice, car cette position fixe déjà son rôle. Il n’est pas la valeur du terme et n’affirme jamais une appartenance de domaine pour cette valeur."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
 msgid "Requires every logic:TermCarrier to carry exactly one term-value kind: IRI, variable, literal, sequence marker, or compound function-term application. It does not constrain the carrier's ordinal; logic:termIndex and list-level contiguity are checked independently."
diff --git slices/grounding/logic/i18n/zh.po slices/grounding/logic/i18n/zh.po
index f3831c801..002ca1fd3 100644
--- slices/grounding/logic/i18n/zh.po
+++ slices/grounding/logic/i18n/zh.po
@@ -5259,16 +5259,16 @@ msgid "Relates a logic:ReasoningContract to the logic:ArgumentationSemantics it
 msgstr "将一个 logic:ReasoningContract 关联到它所选择的 logic:ArgumentationSemantics——可废止论证之间的冲突如何被消解。在契约上单值。定义域 logic:ReasoningContract，值域 logic:ArgumentationSemantics（以散文表述，与模块的定义域/值域约定一致）。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/argument|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "Relates a logic:ArgumentStructure — an atomic-predication logic:Formula (over logic:relation) or a logic:FunctionTerm (over logic:functionSymbol) — to one of its argument term-carriers. The SAME property carries both, so a function term's operands reuse the predication argument machinery. Each carrier fixes its position with logic:termIndex and its value with exactly one term-value property (logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker, or logic:termApplication), so a variadic argument list — including sequence markers and nested compound function terms — round-trips with its order and term kinds intact. It is not a direct link to the term value and carries no ordering by triple position."
-msgstr "将一个 logic:ArgumentStructure——一个原子谓述 logic:Formula（在 logic:relation 上）或一个 logic:FunctionTerm（在 logic:functionSymbol 上）——关联到它的某个论元词项载体。同一个属性承载两者，因此函数项的操作数复用谓述论元机制。每个载体以 logic:termIndex 固定其位置，以恰好一个词项值属性（logic:termIri、logic:termVariable、logic:termLiteral、logic:termSequenceMarker 或 logic:termApplication）固定其值，从而一个可变元论元列表——包括序列标记与嵌套的复合函数项——能在保持其顺序与词项种类完好的情况下往返。它不是通向词项值的直接链接，也不按三元组位置携带任何排序。"
+msgid "Relates a logic:ArgumentStructure to an ordered argument term-carrier. Atomic formulas, function terms and rule inequality guards share this structural link. Each carrier fixes its position with logic:termIndex and its value with exactly one term-value property, preserving order and term kinds independently of RDF statement order. It is not a direct link to the term value."
+msgstr "将 logic:ArgumentStructure 关联到有序参数项载体。原子公式、函数项和规则不等守卫共享此结构链接。每个载体通过 logic:termIndex 确定位置，并通过恰好一个项值属性确定值，从而独立于 RDF 语句顺序保留参数顺序和项种类。它不是指向项值的直接链接。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/argument|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
 msgid "The atom ex:knows(alice,bob) uses carriers at indices 0 and 1 linked through logic:argument."
 msgstr "原子 ex:knows(alice,bob) 使用索引 0 和 1 处的载体，二者通过 logic:argument 相连。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ArgumentStructure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "A node that applies a reified operator to an ordered list of logic:argument term-carriers: an atomic-predication logic:Formula (operator = logic:relation) or a logic:FunctionTerm (operator = logic:functionSymbol). It is the shared rdfs:domain of logic:argument, so the ordered argument-carrier machinery is reused across both without asserting that a function term is a formula or that a formula is a term."
-msgstr "一个将具体化算子作用于 logic:argument 词项载体有序列表的节点：一个原子谓述 logic:Formula（算子 = logic:relation）或一个 logic:FunctionTerm（算子 = logic:functionSymbol）。它是 logic:argument 的共享 rdfs:domain，因此有序的论元载体机制在两者间复用，而不断言函数项是公式或公式是词项。"
+msgid "A node applying an operator to an ordered list of logic:argument term-carriers. The operator is explicit as logic:relation on an atomic logic:Formula or logic:functionSymbol on a logic:FunctionTerm, or supplied structurally by a rule’s logic:distinctBody link. It is the shared domain of logic:argument; sharing the ordered carrier machinery does not assert that a guard or function term is a formula."
+msgstr "对有序 logic:argument 项载体列表应用运算符的节点。运算符可由原子 logic:Formula 上的 logic:relation 或 logic:FunctionTerm 上的 logic:functionSymbol 显式给出，也可由规则的 logic:distinctBody 链接从结构上给出。它是 logic:argument 的共同定义域；共享有序载体机制并不意味着守卫或函数项就是公式。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Aspect|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
 msgid "A moment (trope): an endurant that exists only by inhering in a bearer on which it existentially depends — a colour, a belief, a marriage's commitment. The counterpart of gufo:Aspect, covering its intrinsic/extrinsic split (gufo:IntrinsicAspect inheres in a single bearer, gufo:ExtrinsicAspect depends on several): logic: carries that distinction on the inherence/dependence relation rather than as separate classes. The dependent counterpart of logic:Substantial. Qualities and modes are aspects (stated in prose, not as a subclass edge)."
@@ -6715,8 +6715,8 @@ msgid "Inequality body guard of a logic:Rule. Default-absent: a rule that needs
 msgstr "logic:Rule 的不等式体部守卫。默认缺省：无需不等式的规则不携带 logic:distinctBody，因此现有语料库在字节层面完全一致。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/distinctBody|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "Relates a logic:Rule to an inequality body guard: a reified node carrying rdf:subject and rdf:object (two rule variables, and — unlike logic:body — no rdf:predicate) that must bind to DISTINCT values for the rule to fire, projecting to the Datalog inequality constraint ?A != ?B. Parallel to logic:negatedBody as an additive rule-structural surface: it lets a rule detect 'at least two distinct values' (e.g. a class carrying more than one stereotype, or a relator mediating two distinct relata) that set-semantic Datalog cannot otherwise express. An inequality guard introduces no negative dependency edge, so it leaves a rule's stratification class unchanged."
-msgstr "将一个 logic:Rule 关联到一个不等式体守卫:一个携带 rdf:subject 与 rdf:object(两个规则变量,且——不同于 logic:body——没有 rdf:predicate)的具体化节点,它们必须绑定到不同的取值,规则方可触发,投影为 Datalog 不等式约束 ?A != ?B。作为一种加性的规则结构表面,与 logic:negatedBody 平行:它使一条规则能够检测“至少两个不同取值”(例如一个携带多于一个刻板印象的类,或一个中介两个不同 relata 的关系子),这是集合语义的 Datalog 否则无法表达的。一个不等式守卫不引入任何负依赖边,因此它使一条规则的分层类保持不变。"
+msgid "Relates a logic:Rule to an RDF-term inequality guard with exactly two ordered logic:argument carriers at logic:termIndex 0 and 1, each carrying one logic:termVariable. Both variables must be bound by the positive body and must denote different RDF terms for the rule to fire. This is term identity, not SPARQL value inequality: differently typed numeric literals can be distinct RDF terms with equal values. The guard introduces no negative dependency edge and leaves stratification unchanged. It projects to Datalog term inequality and SPARQL FILTER(!sameTerm(?A, ?B))."
+msgstr "将 logic:Rule 关联到 RDF 项不等守卫。该守卫恰有两个有序的 logic:argument 载体，其 logic:termIndex 分别为 0 和 1，每个载体携带一个 logic:termVariable。两个变量必须由正向规则体绑定，且表示不同的 RDF 项，规则才会触发。这里比较项的同一性，而非 SPARQL 值不等：类型不同的数值字面量可以是不同的 RDF 项，却具有相等的值。该守卫不引入负依赖边，也不改变分层。它投影为 Datalog 项不等和 SPARQL FILTER(!sameTerm(?A, ?B))。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/distinctnessRole|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
 msgid "Relates a logic:RelatumDistinctnessAssertion to one of the two roles that must bind distinct values on a focus node. Exactly two are asserted per record; the native coherence gate raises a violation when both roles bind the same value on one focus node. Domain logic:RelatumDistinctnessAssertion; two-valued. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
@@ -8351,8 +8351,8 @@ msgid "Negation-as-failure body atom of a logic:Rule. Default-absent: a positive
 msgstr "logic:Rule 的失败即否定体部原子。默认缺省：正的 Horn 规则仅有 logic:body 原子而无 logic:negatedBody，因此现有的正语料库不受影响。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/negatedBody|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "Relates a logic:Rule to a negated (negation-as-failure) body atom: the antecedent literal that must NOT be derivable for the rule to fire. Parallel to logic:body (the positive antecedent atoms) but read under closed-world negation, so a rule with any logic:negatedBody atom requires at least logic:StratifiedNAFProfile rather than logic:PositiveHornProfile. The atom itself is a reified rdf:subject/rdf:predicate/rdf:object triple exactly as for logic:body; only its polarity differs."
-msgstr "将一条 logic:Rule 关联到一个被否定的（否定即失败）体原子：为使规则触发而必须不可推导的前件文字。它与 logic:body（正前件原子）平行，但在封闭世界否定下被读取，因此含有任何 logic:negatedBody 原子的规则至少需要 logic:StratifiedNAFProfile，而非 logic:PositiveHornProfile。该原子本身是一个被具体化的 rdf:subject/rdf:predicate/rdf:object 三元组，与 logic:body 完全一致；仅其极性不同。"
+msgid "Relates a logic:Rule to a negation-as-failure body atom: an RDF 1.2 reifier whose rdf:reifies target is the quoted triple term, exactly as for logic:body. Typed logic:TermCarrier resources represent variables in any triple-term position; literals remain literal values. The atom must not be derivable for the rule to fire. A rule with a negated body requires at least logic:StratifiedNAFProfile rather than logic:PositiveHornProfile. Quoting an atom never asserts its proposition."
+msgstr "将 logic:Rule 关联到失败即否定的规则体原子：它是 RDF 1.2 具体化节点，其 rdf:reifies 目标是引用的三元组项，与 logic:body 的表示相同。类型为 logic:TermCarrier 的资源在三元组项的任意位置表示变量；字面量仍保留为字面量值。只有该原子不可推导时，规则才会触发。含否定规则体的规则至少需要 logic:StratifiedNAFProfile，而非 logic:PositiveHornProfile。引用原子绝不等于断言其命题。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/negationOperator|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
 msgid "Relates a logic:ReasoningContract to a logic:NegationOperator its programs may use. Set-valued on the contract: a program may legitimately use explicit (strong) negation and negation-as-failure together, so this records the permitted operator set, not a single chosen operator. Domain logic:ReasoningContract, range logic:NegationOperator (stated in prose, matching the module's convention)."
@@ -10639,8 +10639,8 @@ msgid "A central record asserting that a class is identified by a KEY: the value
 msgstr "一条核心记录,断言某个类由一个键(KEY)来标识:单一键属性的值唯一确定该类的实例,因此两个在键值上一致的实例即为同一个体——而两个被断言为不同却又一致的实例则构成矛盾。它用 logic:keyClass 命名该类,用 logic:keyProperty 命名键属性,原生DL一致性检查门正是通过这一对来判定键一致性冲突,并携带一个指向其所编码的领域属性的 logic:formalizes 反向引用。这是数据类型/单属性键的规范 logic: 载体:独立铸造(是 OWL 2 DL OWL hasKey 公理的 logic: 类比,该公理在数据类型属性上是 OWL 2 Full OWL InverseFunctionalProperty 的DL安全替代方案),因此该键是原生的推理义务,而非源头的 OWL hasKey 三元组。推理权威在此命名并强制执行它;OWL OWL hasKey 公理是其有损的DL视图,派生出的反向 sh:maxCount 1 是其SHACL投影。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "An ordered slot in an atomic formula's logic:argument list, a function term's logic:argument list, or a quantifier's logic:quantifiedVariable block. It carries exactly one zero-based logic:termIndex and exactly one value kind: logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker, or logic:termApplication (a nested compound function term). It is not the term value itself; it is the RDF node that preserves the value's kind and position independently of triple order."
-msgstr "原子公式的 logic:argument 列表、函数项的 logic:argument 列表或量词的 logic:quantifiedVariable 块中的一个有序槽位。它恰好携带一个从零开始的 logic:termIndex 和恰好一种值类型:logic:termIri、logic:termVariable、logic:termLiteral、logic:termSequenceMarker,或 logic:termApplication(一个嵌套的复合函数项)。它本身并非项值;而是独立于三元组顺序、保存该值的类型与位置的RDF节点。"
+msgid "A structural RDF resource preserving one term value and its kind: logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker, or logic:termApplication. An ordered argument or quantified-variable carrier has exactly one zero-based logic:termIndex. A carrier occupying a native RDF 1.2 triple-term position needs no index because that position already fixes its role. It is not the term value itself and never asserts a domain membership for that value."
+msgstr "一种结构性 RDF 资源，保留一个项值及其种类：logic:termIri、logic:termVariable、logic:termLiteral、logic:termSequenceMarker 或 logic:termApplication。有序参数或量化变量载体恰有一个从零开始的 logic:termIndex。占据原生 RDF 1.2 三元组项位置的载体无需索引，因为该位置已确定其角色。载体本身不是项值，也绝不为该值断言领域成员关系。"
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
 msgid "Requires every logic:TermCarrier to carry exactly one term-value kind: IRI, variable, literal, sequence marker, or compound function-term application. It does not constrain the carrier's ordinal; logic:termIndex and list-level contiguity are checked independently."
